 0 0 1 40 624.0898 cm .121569 .160784 .215686 rg BT 15.2 TL/F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 50.2 Tm (Overhead water tanks in homes, hostels and apartments are usually filled by pumps switched by hand. With)Tj T* (no view of the level, tanks overflow and waste water and electricity, or run dry and damage the pump. Project)Tj T* (Cascade is a low-cost IoT tank controller that uses an ESP8266 to measure the water level, show it on a live)Tj T* (web dashboard, and switch the pump automatically or manually.)Tj T* ET Q .101961 .415686 .560784 rg BT/F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 40 596.0898 Tm (2  METHODOLOGY)Tj T* ET q 1 0 0 1 40 448.2898 cm .121569 .160784 .215686 rg BT 15.2 TL/F1 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 126.2 Tm (A waterproof JSN-SR04T ultrasonic sensor on the tank lid measures the distance to the water surface. After)Tj T* (one-time calibration, the ESP8266 takes the median of five readings and converts it to level percentage and)Tj T* (litres. Level and pump status go over Wi-Fi to a live web dashboard that shows the current level and a graph)Tj T* (of water usage over time, where the user sets start and stop thresholds. )Tj/F2 10.6 Tf (In automatic mode)Tj/F1 10.6 Tf (, the ESP8266)Tj T* (turns the pump ON through an opto-isolated relay at the start level and OFF at the stop level. )Tj/F2 10.6 Tf (In manual)Tj T* (mode)Tj/F1 10.6 Tf (, the pump is controlled from the website and phone notifications report pump on/off, no water and)Tj T* (overflow. The control logic runs on the ESP8266 itself, so it keeps working if Wi-Fi fails. Safety rules stop the)Tj T* (pump on a maximum run time, sensor faults or dry running, and the relay stays OFF at boot. Power comes)Tj T* (from the mains through a fuse/MCB and an HLK-PM01 module, all inside an IP65 enclosure.)Tj T* ET Q .07451 .501961 .431373 rg BT/F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 40 420.2898 Tm (3  PROPOSED HARDWARE BLOCK DIAGRAM)Tj T* ET .721569 .329412 .054902 rg 43.5 372.2898 m 201.5919 372.2898 l 203.5267 372.2898 205.0919 373.855 205.0919 375.7898 c 205.0919 404.78